  "abstract": "The Qwen2.5 model is a significant advancement in large language models, offering improved performance, efficiency, and versatility. With a range of model sizes and a robust training process, Qwen2.5 demonstrates state-of-the-art results in various tasks, including natural language understanding, mathematics, coding, and multilingual capabilities.",
