    {
      "title": "The Core Idea",
      "content": "The Qwen2.5 model **builds upon its predecessors** by scaling up the pre-training data from 7 trillion tokens to 18 trillion tokens, and introducing a two-stage reinforcement learning process. This enables the model to develop **emergent capabilities** in language understanding, generation, and reasoning, making it a powerful tool for a wide range of applications.",
