    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "Qwen2.5 uses a **Transformer-based decoder architecture** with several key components, including Grouped Query Attention, SwiGLU activation function, and Rotary Positional Embeddings. The model is trained using a combination of **supervised fine-tuning** and **reinforcement learning**, with a focus on developing capabilities in areas such as mathematics, coding, and instruction-following.",
